   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Get data from StatsBomb open-data repo.\nFind matches with 360 data, keep men's matches only.\nJoin event data and 360 data on event_uuid (360 frame id\n= event id).\n- Event data gives WHO: passer = event player, receiver =\n   pass.recipient.\n- 360 frame gives WHERE: all visible player positions.\n   The event player is the point with actor = true; other\n   points are unlabelled (only teammate / keeper flags).",
   "originalText": "Get data from StatsBomb open-data repo.\nFind matches with 360 data, keep men's matches only.\nJoin event data and 360 data on event_uuid (360 frame id\n= event id).\n- Event data gives WHO: passer = event player, receiver =\n   pass.recipient.\n- 360 frame gives WHERE: all visible player positions.\n   The event player is the point with actor = true; other\n   points are unlabelled (only teammate / keeper flags).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
