   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Collect all COMPLETED passes of the attacking team in the\npossession before the shot.\nIncomplete passes are excluded (no receiver -> receiver\nmetrics cannot be computed).\nPasses without a 360 frame are dropped.\nSet-piece deliveries (corner, free kick, throw-in, goal\nkick) stay in the pool but are flagged with pass.type;\nthey are only compared with the same type.\nRun the pipeline below for each pass; filtering happens\nlater.",
   "originalText": "Collect all COMPLETED passes of the attacking team in the\npossession before the shot.\nIncomplete passes are excluded (no receiver -> receiver\nmetrics cannot be computed).\nPasses without a 360 frame are dropped.\nSet-piece deliveries (corner, free kick, throw-in, goal\nkick) stay in the pool but are flagged with pass.type;\nthey are only compared with the same type.\nRun the pipeline below for each pass; filtering happens\nlater.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
