   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 332738928,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Convert StatsBomb units (yards, 120 x 80) to meters: 1 yd\n= 0.9144 m -> pitch 109.7 x 73.2 m.\nAttacking direction is already normalized by StatsBomb\n(attack left -> right).\nSlice the pitch into cells of N x N m. Start with N = 2,\ntunable later.\ncell = ( floor(x / N), floor(y / N) )  ->  N = 2 gives 55\nx 37 cells.\nExample (N = 2): x = 13.24, y = 25.12  ->  cell (6, 12).",
   "originalText": "Convert StatsBomb units (yards, 120 x 80) to meters: 1 yd\n= 0.9144 m -> pitch 109.7 x 73.2 m.\nAttacking direction is already normalized by StatsBomb\n(attack left -> right).\nSlice the pitch into cells of N x N m. Start with N = 2,\ntunable later.\ncell = ( floor(x / N), floor(y / N) )  ->  N = 2 gives 55\nx 37 cells.\nExample (N = 2): x = 13.24, y = 25.12  ->  cell (6, 12).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
