   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Store both teams' positions in the pass frame.\nPasser = actor point -> known.\nReceiver and defenders are unlabelled points -> use\nplayer continuity below, and the missing-player cases\nwhen they are not in the frame.",
   "originalText": "Store both teams' positions in the pass frame.\nPasser = actor point -> known.\nReceiver and defenders are unlabelled points -> use\nplayer continuity below, and the missing-player cases\nwhen they are not in the frame.",
