   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Inputs:\n1: Pass receipt location\n2: Pass duration (s)\n3: Last frame where receiver is seen\n   (actor or matched) and his location\n4: Time gap dt1 (s) between that frame\n   and the pass frame\n\nReachable heat area =\n  disk( last seen loc, v x dt1 )\n  INTERSECT disk( receipt loc, v x pass\n  duration )\nSpread the area over grid cells as a\nprobability mass.",
   "originalText": "Inputs:\n1: Pass receipt location\n2: Pass duration (s)\n3: Last frame where receiver is seen\n   (actor or matched) and his location\n4: Time gap dt1 (s) between that frame\n   and the pass frame\n\nReachable heat area =\n  disk( last seen loc, v x dt1 )\n  INTERSECT disk( receipt loc, v x pass\n  duration )\nSpread the area over grid cells as a\nprobability mass.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
