   "text": "Defender is not visible at pass time but\nvisible at receipt time (identified via\nframe matching).\n\nReachable heat area =\n  disk( receipt-time loc, v x pass\n  duration )\n  INTERSECT disk( last seen loc, v x dt )\n  (if seen before)\nSpread the area over grid cells as a\nprobability mass.",
   "originalText": "Defender is not visible at pass time but\nvisible at receipt time (identified via\nframe matching).\n\nReachable heat area =\n  disk( receipt-time loc, v x pass\n  duration )\n  INTERSECT disk( last seen loc, v x dt )\n  (if seen before)\nSpread the area over grid cells as a\nprobability mass.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
