  {
   "id": "mYtluYI0KN1gNT11cUzYZ",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": 3660,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 425.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0042",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 874743820,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 25239801,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "v (typical max, elite) = 9.1 m/s  (32.9\n+- 1.4 km/h)\nv_hard (hard limit) = 10.4 m/s  (37.38\nkm/h, highest recorded)\nMax acceleration in match: 5.35 m/s2\nTheoretical max acceleration: 4.5 - 8.68\nm/s2\nUse v for heat areas, v_hard for\nrejecting matches / unreachability.\n\nSources:\n1: Velocity and Acceleration Profile in\n   Football (2025) - Sports (MDPI)\n   https://www.mdpi.com/2075-4663/13/1/18\n2: Analyzing Soccer Match Sprint\n   Distances (2024) - PMC https://pmc.ncb\n   i.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11167479/",
   "originalText": "v (typical max, elite) = 9.1 m/s  (32.9\n+- 1.4 km/h)\nv_hard (hard limit) = 10.4 m/s  (37.38\nkm/h, highest recorded)\nMax acceleration in match: 5.35 m/s2\nTheoretical max acceleration: 4.5 - 8.68\nm/s2\nUse v for heat areas, v_hard for\nrejecting matches / unreachability.\n\nSources:\n1: Velocity and Acceleration Profile in\n   Football (2025) - Sports (MDPI)\n   https://www.mdpi.com/2075-4663/13/1/18\n2: Analyzing Soccer Match Sprint\n   Distances (2024) - PMC https://pmc.ncb\n   i.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11167479/",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
