   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If the intersection is EMPTY (even with v_hard), the\nposition is mathematically unreachable.\nCase 1 -> use the pass receipt location.\nCase 2 -> use the defender's receipt-time location.",
   "originalText": "If the intersection is EMPTY (even with v_hard), the\nposition is mathematically unreachable.\nCase 1 -> use the pass receipt location.\nCase 2 -> use the defender's receipt-time location.",
