   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "confidence = metric score + xG bonus\nxG bonus = shot xG x decay ^ (actions between the pass\nand the shot)\n- Attack ended with a higher-xG shot -> higher\n   confidence.\n- Earlier passes in the chain get less credit (VAEP idea:\n   only the next ~10 actions matter).\n- No shot -> bonus = 0. NO penalty: a good pass without a\n   shot keeps its metric score.",
   "originalText": "confidence = metric score + xG bonus\nxG bonus = shot xG x decay ^ (actions between the pass\nand the shot)\n- Attack ended with a higher-xG shot -> higher\n   confidence.\n- Earlier passes in the chain get less credit (VAEP idea:\n   only the next ~10 actions matter).\n- No shot -> bonus = 0. NO penalty: a good pass without a\n   shot keeps its metric score.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
