   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Compare metric-score distributions: passes in shot-ending\nattacks vs passes in the control group.\nIf high metric scores appear more often before shots (and\nbefore higher-xG shots), the metrics measure something\nreal.\nUse this to tune metric weights and the true-pass\nthreshold.",
   "originalText": "Compare metric-score distributions: passes in shot-ending\nattacks vs passes in the control group.\nIf high metric scores appear more often before shots (and\nbefore higher-xG shots), the metrics measure something\nreal.\nUse this to tune metric weights and the true-pass\nthreshold.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
