   "locked": false,
   "text": "Multi-channel grid tensor",
   "originalText": "Multi-channel grid tensor",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "hOV48vsoUu19X5IQLJhQb",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 470,
   "y": 6905,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 375.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0074",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 649057333,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1325417206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each pass = fixed-size tensor over the grid (size\nindependent of how many players are visible):\nCh 1: Attacking team positions\nCh 2: Defending team positions\nCh 3: Passer location\nCh 4: Receiver location / pass end location\n\nSeen players = Gaussian blob (sigma = 2 - 3 m) so a\n1-cell shift does not kill similarity.\nPredicted players = their heat-area probability mass.\nChannels are kept separate for comparison (see phase 5).\n\nMetadata (NOT in the vector): confidence score + per-\nmetric breakdown, xG bonus, pass.type, start/end zone,\nmatch_id, event ids.",
   "originalText": "Each pass = fixed-size tensor over the grid (size\nindependent of how many players are visible):\nCh 1: Attacking team positions\nCh 2: Defending team positions\nCh 3: Passer location\nCh 4: Receiver location / pass end location\n\nSeen players = Gaussian blob (sigma = 2 - 3 m) so a\n1-cell shift does not kill similarity.\nPredicted players = their heat-area probability mass.\nChannels are kept separate for comparison (see phase 5).\n\nMetadata (NOT in the vector): confidence score + per-\nmetric breakdown, xG bonus, pass.type, start/end zone,\nmatch_id, event ids.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
