   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Split database vs test data BY MATCH (no pass of a test\nmatch in the database -> no leakage).\nFor a new 360 pass: run it through the same pipeline ->\ntensor + metadata.\nkNN = the search procedure; cosine / Wasserstein = how\ncloseness is measured.",
   "originalText": "Split database vs test data BY MATCH (no pass of a test\nmatch in the database -> no leakage).\nFor a new 360 pass: run it through the same pipeline ->\ntensor + metadata.\nkNN = the search procedure; cosine / Wasserstein = how\ncloseness is measured.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
