   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cosine similarity computed PER CHANNEL, then weighted sum\n(so the 10-player team channels do not drown the passer /\nreceiver channels).\nBall-proximity weighting: cells near the ball count more\nthan cells far away.\n-> top 50 candidates. Brute force is enough (tens of\nthousands of passes, no index needed).",
   "originalText": "Cosine similarity computed PER CHANNEL, then weighted sum\n(so the 10-player team channels do not drown the passer /\nreceiver channels).\nBall-proximity weighting: cells near the ball count more\nthan cells far away.\n-> top 50 candidates. Brute force is enough (tens of\nthousands of passes, no index needed).",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
