   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Re-rank the 50 candidates with Wasserstein (optimal\ntransport) distance: compares player distributions by\nmovement cost, robust to small shifts.\n-> top K = 10.\n(Role-alignment methods like Chalkboarding need tracking\nidentities -> not suitable for 360.)",
   "originalText": "Re-rank the 50 candidates with Wasserstein (optimal\ntransport) distance: compares player distributions by\nmovement cost, robust to small shifts.\n-> top K = 10.\n(Role-alignment methods like Chalkboarding need tracking\nidentities -> not suitable for 360.)",
