   "seed": 1018657583,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1870786571,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Data: statsbombpy, pandas, pyarrow -> fetch & join event\n+ 360 data, store as Parquet\nAction chain: socceraction (SPADL) -> standard action\nformat, 'actions until shot' for the xG decay; VAEP lives\nhere too\nGeometry: shapely -> disk intersections (heat areas),\nhalf-circle (metric 1)\nMatching: scipy.optimize.linear_sum_assignment ->\nHungarian algorithm\nTensor: numpy, scipy.ndimage.gaussian_filter -> grid +\nGaussian smoothing\nSimilarity: scikit-learn (cosine), POT - Python Optimal\nTransport (Wasserstein re-ranker)\nEvaluation: scikit-learn.metrics -> Brier score, ROC-AUC,\ncalibration_curve\nVisualization: mplsoccer -> pitch plots, heat areas,\nsimilar passes side by side\n\nFuture (not needed now): FAISS / vector DB (data is tens\nof thousands of passes -> brute force is enough), deep\nlearning framework (only if learned embeddings are added)",
   "originalText": "Data: statsbombpy, pandas, pyarrow -> fetch & join event\n+ 360 data, store as Parquet\nAction chain: socceraction (SPADL) -> standard action\nformat, 'actions until shot' for the xG decay; VAEP lives\nhere too\nGeometry: shapely -> disk intersections (heat areas),\nhalf-circle (metric 1)\nMatching: scipy.optimize.linear_sum_assignment ->\nHungarian algorithm\nTensor: numpy, scipy.ndimage.gaussian_filter -> grid +\nGaussian smoothing\nSimilarity: scikit-learn (cosine), POT - Python Optimal\nTransport (Wasserstein re-ranker)\nEvaluation: scikit-learn.metrics -> Brier score, ROC-AUC,\ncalibration_curve\nVisualization: mplsoccer -> pitch plots, heat areas,\nsimilar passes side by side\n\nFuture (not needed now): FAISS / vector DB (data is tens\nof thousands of passes -> brute force is enough), deep\nlearning framework (only if learned embeddings are added)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
