   "locked": false,
   "text": "Grid cell size N = 2 m\nGaussian sigma = 2 - 3 m\nFree-space radius r = 5 m\nDiagonal band = 20 - 70 deg\nSwitch of play = lateral > 20 m\nChain window = 5 s\nRetriever top = 50, final K = 10\nMin. similarity threshold = TBD\nxG decay = TBD, horizon ~10 actions\nv = 9.1 m/s, v_hard = 10.4 m/s",
   "originalText": "Grid cell size N = 2 m\nGaussian sigma = 2 - 3 m\nFree-space radius r = 5 m\nDiagonal band = 20 - 70 deg\nSwitch of play = lateral > 20 m\nChain window = 5 s\nRetriever top = 50, final K = 10\nMin. similarity threshold = TBD\nxG decay = TBD, horizon ~10 actions\nv = 9.1 m/s, v_hard = 10.4 m/s",
